{
  "_comment": "Shared cases for PRD #3252 M1. Each case seeds the stored planning pair (and optionally default_effort), PUTs body to /api/me/settings, and expects the status and the stored planning pair after the request (a 400 leaves the seed unchanged). The combination cases pin that planning effort and a Runtime default Claude effort save together in either order (Q-spike recorded that omitting effort reverts, so no combination rule exists). Go reads this in api/internal/handler (TestPlanningDefaultsFixture); the Vitest mock consumer is web/src/mocks/mockApi.planningDefaults.test.ts (M2). Codex cases select harness=codex and use the corresponding planning/default Codex keys.",
